      "id": "claim_3e4f5de825f64528a0eb5b1c5d0036be",
      "statement": "PPH's v1 APIs are scheduled for sunset on 2027-03-31 with no extensions (confirmed by the Payments Architecture Review Board on 2026-09-08) because the upcoming Volaris 9.6 upgrade removes the v1 adapter; of the four known v1 consumers, CBO Wire Center's migration (epic CBO-4471, 34 points) is unscheduled and blocked on a prerequisite entitlements mapping story (CBO-4473), which is also unscheduled.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/arb-pay-reg-2026q3-payments-arb-adr-register-and-minutes.md#L50-L55",
