      "id": "claim_f85dad4a6fc14ddf9f6a111cc445d44c",
      "statement": "The Payments Architecture Review Board has not approved direct channel exposure of the gpi snapshot table, and a real-time gpi tracking service (GTSI-0107 / GTRS) is unfunded for 2026 with discovery deferred to 2027-Q2.",
