    {
      "id": "claim_b6eb9b888ea947c185566738d7707c4b",
      "statement": "ADR-PAY-021 confines hold reason codes, descriptions, scores, and analyst notes to the financial-crimes trust boundary; PPH's v2 API exposes only hold.isHeld and hold.holdId, never a reason, and any client-facing hold explanation must come from an FCT-owned, FCC-approved facade returning disclosure tier and approved copy rather than raw reasons.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/arb-pay-reg-2026q3-payments-arb-adr-register-and-minutes.md#L38-L40",
