    {
      "id": "claim_de57bf3b603e446285260c912a6f8365",
      "statement": "PPH still synchronizes HMS's free-text hold description into the legacy v1 field holdReasonDesc for backward compatibility with the Wire Room console; this sync predates ADR-PAY-021, is tracked as open risk FCT-2004 for leaking Restricted-tier text to v1 consumers, and is not present in the v2 API.",
