      "id": "claim_a8a3ed0054874db3aae8f311f25356b2",
      "statement": "CBO Wire Center story CBO-4388, in progress for release R26.21 (production 2026-10-22) with its feature flag defaulting ON, populates a client-visible tooltip on held wires directly from the PPH v1 holdReasonDesc field, and UAT samples showed Restricted-tier HMS text (e.g. fraud model score and sanctions match detail) appearing in that tooltip.",
