    {
      "id": "claim_a532c7d76dd048559f39e53f04a0c97c",
      "statement": "Payments Hub Engineering (Director Raymond Ortiz) owns PPH, Payment Networks Engineering (Director Raj Malhotra) owns the Fedwire Funds Connector, the CBO Wire Center squad (Director Anjali Deshpande, Product Owner Marcus Chen) owns the CBO channel, and Financial Crimes Technology (Director Victor Petrov) owns the Hold Management Service; new client-facing integrations to payment systems require Payments ARB review with a 10-business-day submission lead time.",
